{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":341956,\"title\":\"My Affectionate Enemy\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Anastasia, a young woman with a degree in history, works as a tour guide in Veliky Novgorod. Her boyfriend, Zhenya, proposes to her, and the couple plans to move to Saint Petersburg immediately after their wedding, as Zhenya has finally secured a job there. A terrible tragedy shatters all of Anastasia’s plans: her parents are killed in a car accident, forcing the wedding to be postponed. Zhenya helps organize the funeral, but then—fearing he might lose his job opportunity—he leaves for Saint Petersburg. Anastasia is compelled to stay behind, as she cannot abandon her younger brother. Furthermore, she now finds herself responsible for running the family’s small business—a mini-hotel located at the edge of the forest. Anastasia has no idea how to manage a hotel, and her problems only continue to mount with each passing day…\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1mCZg8XTdL2YYed1VXudSOXwltV.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3RfxWLeje29yfdllyowecvEA328.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2023,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":4,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Domashniy\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"RU\",\"name\":\"Russia\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2023-09-06\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":143681,\"name\":\"Ekaterina Dvigubskaya\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/o4JQIUkDevp2SbcZ9eZPSb1DVHx.jpg\"},{\"id\":1998058,\"name\":\"Evgeniya Vays\",\"character\":\"Vika\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iGHUXDbTTIHTIYj3O44loL4MOab.jpg\"},{\"id\":4163664,\"name\":\"Viktor Mikhailov\",\"character\":\"Igor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nKtTzwZiCVlCN1z9OLRQtldgThX.jpg\"},{\"id\":1496447,\"name\":\"Kristina Kazinskaya\",\"character\":\"Anastasia\",\"photo